// SoC Labs Bug-FC1 fix 2026-05-25: WavD2DGpio.v replaced with local override
// adding post_train_hold_ctr_r so effective_training_mode stays high for N
// link-word cycles past the falling edge of swi_training_mode. Submodule
// copy stays clean for review. See src/rtl/local_overrides/WavD2DGpio.v.
${TIDELINK_HOME}/src/rtl/local_overrides/WavD2DGpio.v
// SoC Labs tdif-04 (2026-05-25, Layer 3): WavD2DGpioRx.v REPLACED by local
// override. Adds T3A_CONTINUOUS parameter (default 1) so the comma-hunt FSM
// re-arms (S_LOCKED → S_HUNT) instead of staying terminal — peer re-entering
// training mode (e.g. after training→FC handoff disturbance) gets re-aligned
// without io_por_reset. The submodule path is OMITTED below to prevent
// duplicate module definitions. See src/rtl/local_overrides/WavD2DGpioRx.v.
${TIDELINK_HOME}/src/rtl/local_overrides/WavD2DGpioRx.v
// SoC Labs tdif-03 (2026-05-25): WavD2DGpioTx.v REPLACED by local override.
// The override adds per-lane word-aligned latching of io_training_mode using
// the instance's own `count` register: the mux only switches between training
// pattern and live link data at a 16-bit word boundary (count: f -> 0). The
// submodule path is OMITTED here (a duplicate module definition would cause
// elaboration errors). Submodule copy at deps/.../WavD2DGpioTx.v stays clean
// for review. See src/rtl/local_overrides/WavD2DGpioTx.v.
${TIDELINK_HOME}/src/rtl/local_overrides/WavD2DGpioTx.v
