// SoC Labs L6 producer-side fix 2026-05-26: WlinkGenericFCSM_6.v REPLACED by
// local override. Adds socl_l6_cr_emit_count counter + gate on _GEN_34 (state
// 1 -> state 2) so the FCSM emits a minimum number of CR(0x44) packets in
// state==1 before allowing exit to state==2, ensuring the asymmetric peer's
// RX framer has time to byte-align onto a CR.  See file header in
// src/rtl/local_overrides/WlinkGenericFCSM_6.v.
${TIDELINK_HOME}/src/rtl/local_overrides/WlinkGenericFCSM_6.v
